# How to create products:
# 1. Go to Stripe Dashboard (Test Mode for testing)
# 2. Products → + Add product
# 3. Fill name, description, and price
# 4. After creating, click "Edit product"
# 5. Scroll to Metadata → Add metadata
# 6. Add both event_slug and distance_index keys with exact values above
# 7. Copy the product ID and price ID here for reference

# Important:
# - event_slug must match exactly from app/data/events.ts
# - distance_index is zero-based (0, 1, 2, etc.)
# - Create separate products in Test Mode and Live Mode
# - Keep this file updated when adding new events/distances
